{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16805","headline":"上巳泛舟得迟字 · 张登","name":"上巳泛舟得迟字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"令节推元巳，天涯喜有期。\n初筵临泛地，旧俗祓禳时。\n枉渚潮新上，残春日正迟。\n竹枝游女曲，桃叶渡江词。\n风鷁今方退，沙鸥亦未疑。\n且同山简醉，倒载莫褰帷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张登","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16805.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16805","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}